@startuml
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Payment Service (mock)" as Pay
Customer -> UI: Checkout
UI -> API: POST /orders (JWT, items)
API -> API: Validate DTO + JWT
API -> DB: BEGIN; read price/options/stock
DB --> API: Catalog + inventory
API -> DB: INSERT order/items; decrement stock
DB --> API: COMMIT + orderId
API --> UI: 201 PENDING_PAYMENT
UI -> API: POST /orders/{id}/pay + Idempotency-Key
API -> API: Verify JWT + ownership
API -> DB: Find prior idempotency key
alt replay
 DB --> API: Existing payment/order
 API --> UI: Return prior result (no duplicate)
else first attempt
 API -> Pay: Charge mock method
 alt success
  Pay --> API: approved
  API -> DB: Transaction: SUCCEEDED + CONFIRMED + loyalty
  DB --> API: committed
  API --> UI: confirmed + order number
 else failure
  Pay --> API: declined
  API -> DB: FAILED + PAYMENT_FAILED
  DB --> API: committed
  API --> UI: failure + retry guidance
 end
end
UI --> Customer: Show final state
@enduml
